<title>USA: Quinsa sees improved second half.</title>
<headline>Quinsa sees improved second half.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxembourg-based Quilmes Industrial SA said on Wednesday it expects improved second half results because it anticipates improved economies in Argentina, Paraguay and Uruguay.</p>
<p>&quot;We anticipate that economic growth, one of the driving factors to strengthen demand for Quinsa's products, should resume in the second half of 1996 which...should fuel both volume and profit growth,&quot; chief executive officer Norberto Morita said in a statement.</p>
</text>
